<view class="login-page">
  <view class="brand-mark">G</view>
  <view class="title">欢迎来到 GymExtra</view>
  <view class="subtitle">建立你的训练档案，以后打开即可自动登录</view>

  <view wx:if="{{checking}}" class="checking">正在识别微信登录身份…</view>

  <view wx:else class="register-card">
    <form bindsubmit="onSubmit">
      <button class="avatar-button" open-type="chooseAvatar" bindchooseavatar="onChooseAvatar">
        <image class="avatar" src="{{avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"></image>
        <view class="avatar-hint">选择微信头像（可选）</view>
      </button>

      <view class="field-label">昵称</view>
      <input
        class="nickname-input"
        name="nickname"
        type="nickname"
        value="{{nickname}}"
        maxlength="20"
        placeholder="填写微信昵称"
        bindinput="onNicknameInput"
        bindblur="onNicknameInput"
      />

      <button class="submit-button" form-type="submit" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}">
        注册并进入
      </button>
    </form>

    <view class="privacy-note">
      如果 iPhone 未弹出头像选择窗口，可填写昵称后直接注册。小程序使用微信为本小程序生成的唯一 OpenID 作为账户 ID，仅保存你主动填写的资料。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
